        "info": "Press one of the inject buttons to set the shared state `exampleTempC` (unit C).\nThe get-shared-state node for `exampleTempC` sends `msg.state.config` with the source unit along with the value, so the set-shared-state node for `exampleTempF` (unit F, precision 1) converts it: 21.5 C becomes 70.7 F, 100 C becomes 212 F. A value without `msg.state.config` (for example straight from an inject node) would be stored without conversion.\n\nPersist is set to Off, so nothing is written to disk."
